# psi/test_espc.py Window test_win_m10_exshow's edit (the pin
# M10_PINS['pmacs'], docs/simpos/screens/pmacs_editor.png): Login PIMOS
# from the system menu; the HELD disc/exshow.esp started by the M10
# harness (`start exshow`, OURS); a left click in its window selects it;
# `Hi`, C-n, `x`, C-x C-s (the stand-in's bindings, standard_editor.esp)
click r 640 560
click r 640 560
click l 978 605
quiet
start exshow
click l 200 150
type Hi
ctrlkey n
type x
ctrlkey x
ctrlkey s
quiet
